{"seq":2,"slug":"compute-shaders","title":"计算着色器","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web3d-visualization/webgpu-intro/compute-shaders","wordCount":772,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"计算着色器\">计算着色器</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>计算着色器（Compute Shader）是 WebGPU 相比 WebGL 最重大的能力飞跃。它允许开发者直接利用 GPU 的大规模并行计算能力处理通用计算任务，而不仅限于图形渲染。GPU 拥有数千个计算核心，擅长处理高度并行的数据密集型任务——如矩阵运算、粒子模拟、图像处理和机器学习推理。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[计算任务] --&gt; B[CPU 串行处理]&#10;    A --&gt; C[GPU 并行处理]&#10;    B --&gt; D[逐元素处理]&#10;    C --&gt; E[工作组 Workgroup]&#10;    E --&gt; F[线程 1]&#10;    E --&gt; G[线程 2]&#10;    E --&gt; H[线程 N]&#10;    F --&gt; I[共享内存]&#10;    G --&gt; I&#10;    H --&gt; I&#10;    I --&gt; J[全局内存]\">graph TD\n    A[计算任务] --&gt; B[CPU 串行处理]\n    A --&gt; C[GPU 并行处理]\n    B --&gt; D[逐元素处理]\n    C --&gt; E[工作组 Workgroup]\n    E --&gt; F[线程 1]\n    E --&gt; G[线程 2]\n    E --&gt; H[线程 N]\n    F --&gt; I[共享内存]\n    G --&gt; I\n    H --&gt; I\n    I --&gt; J[全局内存]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>CPU 计算</th>\n<th>WebGL 模拟计算</th>\n<th>WebGPU 计算着色器</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>并行度</td>\n<td>4-16 线程</td>\n<td>受限于纹理操作</td>\n<td>数千线程</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>编程模型</td>\n<td>串行为主</td>\n<td>通过渲染管线绕行</td>\n<td>原生并行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>共享内存</td>\n<td>系统内存</td>\n<td>不支持</td>\n<td>工作组共享内存</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>原子操作</td>\n<td>支持</td>\n<td>不支持</td>\n<td>支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>调试难度</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用数据量</td>\n<td>千级</td>\n<td>万级</td>\n<td>百万级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据传输</td>\n<td>无（内存直接）</td>\n<td>GPU↔CPU 频繁</td>\n<td>GPU 内部计算</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>计算着色器的核心编程模型基于<strong>工作组</strong>（Workgroup）：一个计算任务被划分为多个工作组，每个工作组包含固定数量的线程（invocation），工作组内的线程可以通过共享内存高效通信。</p>\n<h2 id=\"计算着色器基础\">计算着色器基础</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const computeShader = `&#10;@group(0) @binding(0) var&lt;storage, read&gt; inputData: array&lt;f32&gt;;&#10;@group(0) @binding(1) var&lt;storage, read_write&gt; outputData: array&lt;f32&gt;;&#10;&#10;@compute @workgroup_size(256)&#10;fn main(@builtin(global_invocation_id) globalId: vec3&lt;u32&gt;) {&#10;  let index = globalId.x;&#10;  if (index &gt;= arrayLength(&amp;inputData)) {&#10;    return;&#10;  }&#10;  outputData[index] = inputData[index] * 2.0 + 1.0;&#10;}&#10;`;&#10;&#10;const runComputeShader = async (device: GPUDevice, inputArray: Float32Array): Promise&lt;Float32Array&gt; =&gt; {&#10;  const inputBuffer = device.createBuffer({&#10;    size: inputArray.byteLength,&#10;    usage: GPUBufferUsage.STORAGE | GPUBufferUsage.COPY_DST,&#10;  });&#10;  device.queue.writeBuffer(inputBuffer, 0, inputArray);&#10;&#10;  const outputBuffer = device.createBuffer({&#10;    size: inputArray.byteLength,&#10;    usage: GPUBufferUsage.STORAGE | GPUBufferUsage.COPY_SRC,&#10;  });&#10;&#10;  const readBuffer = device.createBuffer({&#10;    size: inputArray.byteLength,&#10;    usage: GPUBufferUsage.MAP_READ | GPUBufferUsage.COPY_DST,&#10;  });&#10;&#10;  const shaderModule = device.createShaderModule({ code: computeShader });&#10;&#10;  const pipeline = device.createComputePipeline({&#10;    layout: &#39;auto&#39;,&#10;    compute: { module: shaderModule, entryPoint: &#39;main&#39; },&#10;  });&#10;&#10;  const bindGroup = device.createBindGroup({&#10;    layout: pipeline.getBindGroupLayout(0),&#10;    entries: [&#10;      { binding: 0, resource: { buffer: inputBuffer } },&#10;      { binding: 1, resource: { buffer: outputBuffer } },&#10;    ],&#10;  });&#10;&#10;  const encoder = device.createCommandEncoder();&#10;  const pass = encoder.beginComputePass();&#10;  pass.setPipeline(pipeline);&#10;  pass.setBindGroup(0, bindGroup);&#10;  pass.dispatchWorkgroups(Math.ceil(inputArray.length / 256));&#10;  pass.end();&#10;&#10;  encoder.copyBufferToBuffer(outputBuffer, 0, readBuffer, 0, inputArray.byteLength);&#10;  device.queue.submit([encoder.finish()]);&#10;&#10;  await readBuffer.mapAsync(GPUMapMode.READ);&#10;  const result = new Float32Array(readBuffer.getMappedRange().slice(0));&#10;  readBuffer.unmap();&#10;&#10;  return result;&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> computeShader</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">@group(0) @binding(0) var&#x3C;storage, read> inputData: array&#x3C;f32>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">@group(0) @binding(1) var&#x3C;storage, read_write> outputData: array&#x3C;f32>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">@compute @workgroup_size(256)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">fn main(@builtin(global_invocation_id) globalId: vec3&#x3C;u32>) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  let index = globalId.x;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  if (index >= arrayLength(&#x26;inputData)) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    return;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  outputData[index] = inputData[index] * 2.0 + 1.0;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`</span><span style=